title: "Distribution Center Digital Twin (dc-twin)"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "OYC"
abstract: >-
  A Blender 5.2 based digital twin of a four-warehouse distribution center
  with 21 AGVs, closed-loop A* task planning, a reproducible four-layer
  configuration and 40 independent acceptance checks.
